{"3582440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DSS 2: War Industry", "steam_appid": 3582440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4820280], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DSS is a real-time grand strategy game with city-building and resource management.<br><br>Experience a groundbreaking game with limitless armies, endless cities, and unparalleled resource simulation. Built to redefine wargames and push the boundaries of scale and depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582440/extras/3b087aceaa934d23f145a9601f630eed.poster.avif?t=1787334880\" width=800 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582440/extras/3b087aceaa934d23f145a9601f630eed.webm?t=1787334880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582440/extras/3b087aceaa934d23f145a9601f630eed.mp4?t=1787334880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >City Building</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct and develop your cities to support your war efforts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Workers will automatically complete tasks in order of priority.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send settlers to found new cities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582440/extras/6b25f6a709f2ca227cf5477f61ba004f.poster.avif?t=1787334880\" width=800 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582440/extras/6b25f6a709f2ca227cf5477f61ba004f.webm?t=1787334880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582440/extras/6b25f6a709f2ca227cf5477f61ba004f.mp4?t=1787334880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Capture and Breed Mounts</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soldiers can be any combination of animals, weapons and equipment.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582440/extras/982245ecc4fc07ad93aa4e882e4f4b5c.poster.avif?t=1787334880\" width=800 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582440/extras/982245ecc4fc07ad93aa4e882e4f4b5c.webm?t=1787334880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582440/extras/982245ecc4fc07ad93aa4e882e4f4b5c.mp4?t=1787334880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer Co-op</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can drop in or out at any time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share resources with each other.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >64-player online or 4-player split-screen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable per-player difficulty and casual/advanced controls—great for teaming up with younger players or beginners.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582440/extras/fefaa65f46d6096d2227274b502890fe.poster.avif?t=1787334880\" width=800 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582440/extras/fefaa65f46d6096d2227274b502890fe.webm?t=1787334880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582440/extras/fefaa65f46d6096d2227274b502890fe.mp4?t=1787334880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Other Features </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defenses</strong>: Turtle up with fortifications and guard posts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Management</strong>: Establish production chains using logistics networks to ensure an efficient economy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades</strong>: Research science, unlock tech trees, and gain experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Automation</strong>: Set up your medieval industry to keep running while you’re off conquering new lands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Army Tactics</strong>: Command your forces across the map while keeping them well-supplied and fed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modular Military Units</strong>: Create soldiers by combining items and specializations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diplomacy</strong>: Coerce others into joining your cause.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flexible Game Modes</strong>: From intense boss battles to peaceful, creative building.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Difficulty</strong>: Most systems run by themselves — you choose what to focus on or leave alone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Massive Scale</strong>: Hundreds of thousands of soldiers and workers are simulated in real time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Map Generator</strong>: Each game offers new tactical situations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creation Tools</strong>: Design maps, flags, characters, and voxel models.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle Lab</strong>: Form armies and pit them against each other.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582440/extras/e00051111cde4e4676d0972f67c7d1d7.webp?t=1787334880\" width=90 height=30 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DSS is a real-time grand strategy game with city-building and resource management.<br><br>Experience a groundbreaking game with limitless armies, endless cities, and unparalleled resource simulation. Built to redefine wargames and push the boundaries of scale and depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582440/extras/3b087aceaa934d23f145a9601f630eed.poster.avif?t=1787334880\" width=800 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582440/extras/3b087aceaa934d23f145a9601f630eed.webm?t=1787334880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582440/extras/3b087aceaa934d23f145a9601f630eed.mp4?t=1787334880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >City Building</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct and develop your cities to support your war efforts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Workers will automatically complete tasks in order of priority.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send settlers to found new cities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582440/extras/6b25f6a709f2ca227cf5477f61ba004f.poster.avif?t=1787334880\" width=800 height=288 ><source src=